WEBVTT

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:04.980
But I single-handedly ruined your dreams.

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:07.150
Oh, I'm an idol.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.570
Making people smile is my job.

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:11.780
We can't start without you.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:13.490
Nanase-san.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:19.620
You will officially debut 
with Takanashi Productions.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.540
The debut song will be "Miss You."

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.700
It's a remix of the song 
you sang at <i>Music Festa</i>.

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:29.700
That song belongs to you two now.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:31.680
Yes, sir...

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.290
Boss, can I ask a favor?

00:00:34.290 --> 00:00:34.930
What is it?

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.770
I want a new group name.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.490
IDOLiSH7 is the name for the seven of us.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:46.990
I don't want to be called IDOLiSH7 
unless we're all together.

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:48.610
I'd like to make the same request.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.450
Don't worry. I know just the thing.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:55.030
Your duo name will be "MEZZO"."

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.530
As in the "mezzo" from 
mezzo forte and mezzo piano.

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:00.530
MEZZO"...

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:03.520
Your voices go very well together.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:06.350
Just like your voices, I want 
you to unite your souls,

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:10.000
try your best, and hold in your hearts the
 feelings the seven of you put into this song.

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:14.530
I want you two to open a path 
for the rest of you to walk.

00:01:14.530 --> 00:01:15.300
Yes, sir!

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.890
Okay, so let's get ready!

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:19.760
Your job for today is to relax!

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:24.980
Well, let's go!

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:34.150
Gazing at the distant sky...

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:37.700
Someday we'll make it past there

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:43.310
Build a rainbow Next Harmony!

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:50.130
We don't know what's right

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:53.340
So we Try and Jump!

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:56.510
Slamming face first into 
challenges and laughing

00:01:56.510 --> 00:02:00.140
For us It's Only Way!

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:03.320
Make it shake (For Your Sky)

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:06.820
Make it reach (For Your Heart)

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:09.310
We'll change any and all kinds of pain

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:10.470
Do Live! (Yeah!)

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:11.310
Live! (Yeah!)

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:14.730
In the light!

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:15.530
(One, Two, Three, Four, Five, Six, Seven Go!)

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:21.990
Yes Glory Days! Together 
we'll run through them

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:24.810
If your voice (Fuu!) reverberates (Dream!)

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:28.290
Then your wishes will become 
destiny (Singing New World!)

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:34.800
Give rise now to Age of Stage!

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:41.760
The future surely lies on the other side

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:44.680
Yes... It will keep on evolving

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:48.060
Our WiSH VOYAGE

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:54.320
Build a rainbow Next Harmony!

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:03.030
Precious Time

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:05.620
Wow, a river!

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.450
Think there's fish in there?

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:08.500
Don't fall in!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:10.250
What a nice place!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.300
Nice call, Banri-kun!

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:13.180
Yes, sir!

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:16.900
You two look like you're ready 
to make the most of this...

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:19.470
Oh? Yamato-kun, would you 
like a matching outfit?

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:20.830
I'm good, thanks...

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:24.070
Are you okay?

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.050
Just riding in a car can 
be pretty exhausting...

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:27.050
No, I'm fine.

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:29.140
Hey, boys! Hands up!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.940
Let's have a little gun shooting!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:34.560
It seems a little early for water guns...

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:37.310
Oh, no need to worry!

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:41.440
I'm beautiful when I'm wet!

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:43.990
And it's girls that I'm hunting.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:46.110
Now, let's go!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:47.530
To pick up women?

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:50.660
Hey, Nagi!

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:56.790
I got the keys to the bungalows!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.010
Thanks. Should we carry our stuff there?

00:03:59.010 --> 00:03:59.490
Okay.

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:01.010
Ah, wait a minute!

00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:03.650
I'll carry it.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.550
Iori, you go play.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.610
Play?

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.680
Take that, Nagi!

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:12.150
Oh, go easy on me, please!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.050
What are you doing?

00:04:15.050 --> 00:04:17.380
Chilling my King Pudding.

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.480
Iorin, you want a crab?

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:23.170
I caught it earlier.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:23.910
Wanna eat it?

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.110
No, thank you.

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:27.650
They're delicious fried.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:30.290
Manager said the same thing.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:33.410
Everyone, want anything while we're out?

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:35.210
The president and I are heading out shopping.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:35.920
Booze!

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.170
King Pudding!

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:40.840
I think you have more than enough...

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:45.510
Well, let's split into teams: Curry 
team, fishing team, and fire team.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:46.300
Fishing team!

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.480
I want fishing, too!

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:49.260
Catch and release!

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.370
We're not releasing anything...

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.140
Nagi, you're on the fire team with me, then.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.610
Okay!

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:57.170
I'll get it burning hotter than my love!

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:59.060
Be careful around fire, okay?

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.540
What will we fish with?

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.280
I don't want to touch
ones that are still alive...

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.910
So and Tama, you can be the curry team.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.200
You need to practice your teamwork.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.380
Sure, leave it to me.

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:12.990
Though I've never peeled vegetables before...

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:15.260
You still want the job if 
you've never done it before?

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:17.190
You can do the peeling, So-chan.

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.550
You gotta do it too, Tamaki!

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:22.800
I just got a flash of how 
their duo's going to work...

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:25.370
Don't do it all by yourself, So.

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:27.380
You need to make Tama 
take some responsibility.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:30.600
The fans will be happier 
if you two get along.

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:33.770
That's true.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:36.100
Iori will be fishing with us!

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:38.060
Let's compete!

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.070
Is it really impossible?

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:45.710
To let them debut together, as IDOLiSH7...

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:47.300
It does seem a bit soon.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:50.570
With their name recognition as low as
 it is now, they'd get buried right away.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.080
But, they're so...

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:55.160
They're doing their best.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:06:00.150
If doing their best was enough, 
everyone could be a star tomorrow.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.410
Don't worry. They're strong.

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:07.130
They have the power to make 
their dreams come true.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:10.330
They're just so young.

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:12.470
For some of them, this has 
been their first setback.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:15.470
Yeah. Hence the barbecue, eh?

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:20.210
We're older, so we've been through 
our share of setbacks and failures,

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:22.830
and we know how to bounce back from them.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.110
Another one got away!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:29.320
You idiot! They just ate the bait.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:34.240
The fish must be happy we opened this free 
restaurant for them right on the river...

00:06:35.810 --> 00:06:37.140
Hey, Mitsuki!

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:39.330
What was Iori like as a kid?

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:41.490
Well, this one time...

00:06:41.490 --> 00:06:44.750
Actually, there's not an 
embarrassing episode to speak of.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.490
I have a lot of cute stories 
about you, Nii-san.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:48.420
Shut up!

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.610
What about you?

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:53.050
Any embarrassing stories about Kujo Tenn?

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.260
About Tenn-nii?

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:57.220
Yeah, yeah! Something
 I could sell to the media.

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:02.650
Tenn-nii was good at everything, 
and he was nice, too.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:07.640
So why'd someone like 
that abandon his family?

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.850
Was he <i>really</i> that nice?

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:12.200
These brothers...

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:13.990
It's lit!

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.200
Behold!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:20.000
Like this fire, my heart is 
burning hot with love for you!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.810
It was a fleeting love.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.380
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.050
Give me that fan!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.810
Oh, oh!

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:30.920
See? It's blazing again!

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:38.100
You also reignited <i>our</i> flame 
when it was going out, too.

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:42.730
After <i>Music Festa</i>, when we 
were nearly reduced to ash...

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.730
I'm grateful, Nagi.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.150
Yeah! That's five!

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:49.670
Why?!

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:54.250
I love you all.

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.930
I didn't want to see you sad.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.010
That's all.

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:06.090
Our fans are going to get sadder and sadder.

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:08.920
I want to make them happy again.

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:10.510
True.

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:14.400
For instance, I could give 
them each a hug and kiss!

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.680
Are you trying to sink us with a scandal?

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:19.200
I am beautiful.

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:23.130
The kiss of a beautiful man is 
worth at least a little happiness.

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:24.790
You son of a...

00:08:25.270 --> 00:08:28.840
But when I look at you close-up, 
you really are attractive.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.130
You're half-Japanese, right?

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:31.060
What's the other half?

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:32.140
Northmarea.

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:34.820
It's a beautiful country, far up north.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:37.600
Oh, you can see the aurora from there, right?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.540
But if you're from Northern Europe, English 
wouldn't be your native language, right?

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.700
Yes!

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:45.130
Northmarea has its own language.

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:47.190
It's similar to Danish.

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:49.580
Including English...

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:52.210
I speak eight languages!

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.090
Why are you so shocked?

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.860
Sorry.

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:03.690
Your Japanese is so weird, I just
 assumed you were an idiot.

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:06.630
No! I'm very smart!

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:08.150
And I'm beautiful!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:11.230
And ladies love my body!

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.930
Which is why I've never had any friends.

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:17.780
It's probably because you say 
those things about yourself...

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:20.160
Why did you come to Japan?

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:24.330
My mother is Japanese.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.030
I've always loved Japan.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:31.300
Japan's songs, anime, girls, 
movies... I love them all!

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.030
Samurai! Chiba Shizuo!

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:35.550
The art of the sword!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.230
Chiba Shizuo-san!

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:40.300
He's that big-time Japanese actor, isn't he?

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:42.510
Yes! My mother was a fan!

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.110
She often told my father...

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:50.630
"The samurai treasure their wives and
are the pinnacle of manliness! Study them!"

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:54.520
I hear he's still deeply in love 
with that former actress he married.

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:56.990
I hope I can still be in love at that age!

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.220
I am a fan of Cocona.

00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:01.570
And a fan of IDOLiSH7.

00:10:01.570 --> 00:10:05.160
And I love its members, my first friends.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:06.660
I'm a fan, too!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:08.670
Oh! Then we're a team!

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:09.920
Yes!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.340
A team, eh?

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:18.840
I hope we can all do our best and 
perform as a team of seven soon...

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:20.660
In order to make that happen...

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:24.010
Those two need to do the best they can.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:27.520
So-chan, you finish the rest.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.990
No! Please, keep trying.

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:31.930
You can do it faster by yourself.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:34.850
Maybe so, but it's like the president said.

00:10:34.850 --> 00:10:37.450
If we don't try our best, 
it's going to hurt everyone.

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:40.090
Let's see this through so they 
don't have to worry, okay?

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:41.890
Everyone, huh?

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:47.370
Just working all the time gets boring.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.700
Let's talk a little.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.210
We are talking.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.170
I don't mean like that...

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:53.510
I mean hobbies, likes...

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:57.380
Yamato-san said the fans would 
be happier if we get along...

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:00.380
I think you do what other 
people tell you too often.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:08.630
If you said you wanted to get 
along, that would be one thing.

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:11.310
But to get along just because 
someone else tells you to...

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.400
That doesn't make me happy at all.

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:16.390
That wasn't how I meant it.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:18.390
You liar.

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:21.070
So-chan, I know you hate me.

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:23.370
You're the one who hates me.

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:26.430
It comes across in everything you say and do.

00:11:26.430 --> 00:11:27.240
How?

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:30.280
You say I'm nagging, that I'm boring,

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:33.830
that I have it easy, that all 
I have to do is stand there...

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:36.050
Do I say that stuff?

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:36.590
Yes.

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:37.720
No way.

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:39.440
I'm sorry, then.

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:40.220
Forgive me?

00:11:42.150 --> 00:11:42.970
Did you forgive me?

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:43.970
Look...

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.050
What, are you mad?

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:48.060
I thought you wanted to get along.

00:11:48.970 --> 00:11:50.610
Don't give me the silent treatment.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:52.500
Just say something.

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.100
So annoying.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.660
Listen, Tamaki-kun.

00:11:57.660 --> 00:12:01.330
I'm an adult, so I won't play your game.

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:04.910
You just want everyone to think 
you're the good boy, that's all.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:08.960
I see teacher's pets like you in school, too.

00:12:08.960 --> 00:12:14.920
Sorry, but I'm not gonna get along with 
you so that Yama-san will praise y—

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.740
Pick up the potato.

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:18.390
Pick up the peeler.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.480
Peel from top to bottom.

00:12:21.480 --> 00:12:23.670
Dig the eyes out with the tip.

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:25.390
Are you threatening me?!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:26.850
Must I repeat myself?

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.580
I'll do it! I'll do it!

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:36.690
But that ice cold stare of 
Kujo's really got to me...

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:41.260
Every night since, I've had 
dreams about the concert.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:46.910
We're at the same studio, singing the 
same song, dancing the same dance...

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:50.370
Then you forget the song the same 
way and wake up in a cold sweat?

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:54.000
Apparently, you're also
insensitive on top of being stupid!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.380
You never show any sensitivity, either...

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.120
But I am sorry.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.510
If I go too far, I bet 
you'll start crying again!

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:03.510
Do you want me to push you in?!

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:04.170
You wanna go?!

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:07.340
You're gonna drive the fish 
away if you don't shut up!

00:13:08.270 --> 00:13:10.060
Sorry, I'll be quiet.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:14.100
You think loudmouth Nanase-san 
could ever keep quiet?

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.110
Iori...

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.600
You were cute when you
 were crying, either way.

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:22.940
Iori!

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:27.430
Don't worry. You're cute 
even when you're not crying.

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:29.490
Nii-san...

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.910
That's right!

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.710
It's cold!

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:38.620
Sorry! Are you okay?

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:40.090
Nanase-san...

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.550
The fish!

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:45.670
The fish!

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:53.470
Got your drinks, everyone?

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:54.980
Well, then...

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.980
Cheers!

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:01.800
Delicious! I love beer!

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:03.880
Mitsuki, give me a taste!

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.070
You're underage!

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:07.420
Iori, want to split a fish?

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:08.820
I'll do it.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.420
Sogo-kun, drink up.

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:12.520
We bought plenty of alcohol!

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:14.700
Uh, sure... just one cup, though.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:17.960
The curry is so delicious!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:18.970
Yeah!

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:22.390
When we added the roux, it got all curry-ish, 
and the excitement was through the roof!

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:24.060
You seem happy, Tama.

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:25.300
You two getting along?

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.320
I wouldn't say...

00:14:27.320 --> 00:14:28.750
We cooked together very well.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:30.830
Tamaki-kun worked very hard.

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:32.260
I was terrified.

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.890
I see, I see.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:36.740
Oh, Tamaki, what's wrong?

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:40.480
You're trembling like you met 
a killer at the riverside...

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.910
Now, let's all eat up!

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.980
Once your stomachs are 
full, we'll play a game!

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:48.030
What kind of game?

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.650
A wholesome king's game!

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:53.740
Is that a game where we get King Pudding?!

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.560
I don't think pudding is involved.

00:14:55.560 --> 00:14:56.540
Oh...

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:00.370
What's the point of playing 
a king's game wholesomely?

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.630
Is Manager playing, too?

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:04.670
Old man, you're a pervert.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.620
What? I-Is it perverted?

00:15:06.620 --> 00:15:08.300
K-Kissing and stuff?

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:12.510
If anyone orders my daughter to do anything 
strange, I'll step in for her.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.470
Oh. What a dandy stand-in.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:17.640
Well, let's get started!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.170
King's game!

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.400
Who's the king?

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:23.610
I'm six!

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:25.060
I'm three.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.110
Don't say it yet!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.190
Iori, what's your number?

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.290
It's me!

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:33.190
Well, let's start out safe!

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:35.080
One must flick ten in the forehead!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.030
Forehead flicks can really hurt, huh?

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.080
So, who's one?

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:41.330
I-It's me.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:43.500
And who's ten?

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.080
Me!

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:46.200
The president?!

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.420
Just to let you know, I didn't plan that!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.880
Don't worry. It won't affect your bonus.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:53.160
Go, Sogo!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:55.140
Hit him with all your pent-up anger!

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.430
I don't have any pent-up anger!

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.170
Well, Sogo-kun...

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:01.590
It's no fun if you go easy, 
so give it all you've got!

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.860
Forgive me...

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:12.300
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.220
My fingers aren't used to this...

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.070
Nice fight!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:19.130
Oh, so the king can order anything he wants?

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:21.870
The slightly pervy requests
always liven things up.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.430
Right?

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.450
What have I done?

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:28.970
Don't worry, Sogo-kun.

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:30.390
it was a good forehead flick.

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.550
Thank you very much.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.280
Okay! Things are getting exciting!

00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:38.050
Okay, next one!

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:40.060
Who's the king?

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.680
Oh, it's me.

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:43.600
Lucky!

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:47.680
<i>What's her number?</i>

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:50.020
<i>Three? Seven?</i>

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.700
Six must be a lap pillow for the king!

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.740
That's sexual harassment!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:58.730
No fair!

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:01.240
Shut up! I'm risking it all!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.690
Yamato-kun. If you wish for my daughter 
to offer her lap as your pillow,

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:07.210
you must first defeat my own lap.

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:11.130
Fairness is necessary
 for a good king's game.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:13.050
Manager. What's your number?

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:13.920
Number two!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.170
It's over...

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:16.710
Yes!

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:17.930
So, who's number six?

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.820
It's obviously a guy...

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:21.100
<b>A Man's Lap</b>

00:17:19.820 --> 00:17:21.100
Yamato-san, come on down!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:23.600
No. I don't have any interest 
in another man's lap...

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:25.170
Don't be shy!

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:26.780
I'm really glad you picked me!

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.940
Nanase-san, do you know how this works?

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:30.550
Hurry, hurry!

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:32.280
You're all lucky...

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:35.120
Peace.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.280
Excellent!

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:38.530
Next one's me!

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:43.430
One must confess their love to two, 
and three must get between them!

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:48.810
Then when they're about to punch it out, 
number four arrives with fresh pizza!

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:55.750
Then five takes six hostage, and five's 
mother, seven, tries to talk him down,

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:59.260
when it turns out that seven is 
actually one's long-lost sibling...

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.300
This is taking forever!

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:02.380
Something more simple!

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:04.770
One needs to write their name in shirimoji!

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:05.980
Who's number one?

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:09.100
It's me! What's shirimoji?

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:11.270
It means writing your name 
in the air with your butt!

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:13.010
Like this?

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:14.280
You're gonna do it too, Mitsu?

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:17.030
You're both so cute...

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:18.860
Yes, very cute...

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:20.660
Osaka-san?

00:18:21.590 --> 00:18:23.460
So-chan, not fair!

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.090
You're not even the king!

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:27.370
Ta-kun, shut up.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.330
Ta-kun?!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:31.500
Sogo-san, my legs are going numb...

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:34.320
No! I want my pillow!

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.760
Sogo-san appears to have 
gotten quite drunk...

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:37.900
So have I.

00:18:37.900 --> 00:18:40.080
Let's call it a night.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:41.980
No way! One more!

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:44.100
I haven't gotten to be the king yet!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.580
But I'm exhausted.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:47.350
I'm gonna be the king!

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.350
Who's the king?

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.590
It's me!

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:54.440
Damn it! I wanted to ask for pudding!

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:56.970
I knew he was after pudding.

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:05.410
That king's game was pretty fun, huh?

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.570
Yamato-san's dance of the fairy queen...

00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:15.420
Quiet down. If you don't get enough sleep, 
you'll get carsick on the way back.

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:17.220
I'm not sleepy.

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:18.920
Force yourself to sleep anyway.

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:25.470
Iori, want me to sleep next to you?

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:30.290
You know, in case you 
have another scary dream!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:32.770
Iori?

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:36.570
Nanase-san, you can drop it already.

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:41.910
You've been wondering
all day if I'm okay or not.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:47.160
You keep bringing up ways to ask 
if I'm worried about my failure.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:50.300
You were trying to see if 
I'd snap back at you or not.

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:55.820
What if you tear yourself down while 
digging at someone else's wounds?

00:19:58.020 --> 00:19:59.510
I'm not torn down.

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:01.650
Nanase-san, you're awful at this.

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:04.140
Seriously, I'm fine.

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:08.270
What is it?

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:09.520
That made me happy!

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:14.310
Let me join in the pillow fight!

00:20:14.870 --> 00:20:17.180
Are we pillow fighting?

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:18.150
I woke him...

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.280
We're not pillow fighting!

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:20.780
Let me in!

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.740
Extreme pillow talk!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:24.200
What's that supposed to mean?

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.590
Iorin, are you feeling better?

00:20:26.590 --> 00:20:28.150
You don't show any mercy!

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:32.540
You're okay when you're sad, but I like
 you best the way you usually are!

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:35.340
You're the one who was sad, Nanase-san!

00:20:35.810 --> 00:20:38.040
Let me just say, it was really obvious!

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:39.710
I did that on purpose!

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:41.920
You're not that good an actor.

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.250
Gonna cry again?

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:45.090
I won't cry.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:49.220
No matter what happens next time... 
I'll deal with it right away.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:56.340
I... um... I'm gonna watch my 
health and sing my heart out!

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:58.980
I won't make you worry ever again!

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.580
I never worried!

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:04.740
I'm gonna work harder, too!

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:05.750
Yes—

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:09.260
And I... I'm gonna do 
my best where I have to!

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:11.120
Then let's start round two!

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.070
Do you have any idea what time it is?!

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:15.340
You're bothering the other guests!

00:21:16.090 --> 00:21:17.920
Sorry.

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:19.410
Sorry.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:30.050
Iori-san?

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:35.850
Good morning. I'm sorry 
about the noise last night.

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:38.660
Regarding the debut of MEZZO"...

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:40.670
However much extra exposure those two get,

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:43.110
I want more exposure time 
for the seven of us.

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:47.490
I know it'll be hard to work out 
extra time right after their debut,

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:50.250
so I'd prefer platforms with the 
most flexible schedule possible,

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:53.120
such as web shows.

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:58.870
Videos of our live shows are popular lately, 
too, and right now, getting noticed is...

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:00.380
What is it?

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:01.530
Nothing.

00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:04.170
I think doing a show all 
together would be great!

00:22:04.170 --> 00:22:05.530
As do I.

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:08.690
I want to debut with 
IDOLiSH7, all seven of us.

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:11.550
Let's think of ways we can do that.

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:12.840
Okay!

00:22:12.840 --> 00:22:14.420
I'm going to wake everyone up.

00:22:14.420 --> 00:22:16.770
We need to catch up for the day we took off.

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:17.890
I'll help!

00:22:34.410 --> 00:22:37.950
Start running (beyond)

00:22:37.950 --> 00:22:44.960
Your imagination... Alive

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:58.610
If you desire something from 
the bottom of your heart

00:22:58.610 --> 00:23:03.270
Risk your life and dive in

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:08.360
The resolve to discard what's truly important

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:13.490
Is the boat that will take you to new sights

00:23:13.490 --> 00:23:16.040
(Hey man!) Take the strings of your heart

00:23:16.390 --> 00:23:18.580
(Hey man!) And stretch them

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.460
(Say dream!) To the limit

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:26.380
At the other end you're sure 
to find the Gate to paradise

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:32.450
You'll be the first witness

00:23:32.450 --> 00:23:37.240
Our pounding pulses are Heavenly

00:23:37.240 --> 00:23:42.530
Admit that you can't deny it

00:23:42.530 --> 00:23:46.820
We start... What do your fingertips

00:23:46.820 --> 00:23:51.240
Seek now?
